    "title": "Several graduates of IED Pakistan selected as head teachers",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Several MEd graduates of IED, Pakistan have been appointed as head teachers for government schools.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "ab811ae4c1645b66",
        "component": "news_media",
