    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Several MEd graduates of IED, Pakistan have been appointed as head teachers for government schools."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A total of 13 graduates, 10 from Gilgit-Baltistan and three from Balochistan, were selected after passing the prestigious Federal Public Service Commission examination."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As school heads, these individuals will not only be able to enact change and reform in their own schools but will also provide professional guidance to teachers and schools in their areas, building capacity in the larger community."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The outstanding performance of these graduates in the examination highlights the quality and efficacy of IED's Master's programme."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The two-year MEd prepares graduates to become facilitators of positive change within their school systems by developing their skills as reflective practitioners, classroom researchers and life-long learners."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
